# No manual AI configuration is required: the app uses the Lovable AI Gateway,
# whose server-side credentials are provided automatically by the hosting
# environment. This file exists to document that no secrets are needed and
# none should ever be committed.
#
# If you migrate to a direct OpenAI/Anthropic API key instead, add it here as
# a server-only variable (never VITE_*-prefixed) and keep this file out of git:
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
